  "sourceFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Pokřivení informace</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> August 2018 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>Přes kolik zprostředkovatelů se k nám dostane článek, který vidíme na internetu? Je jeho pravdivost věrohodná? Jak moc jiný je svět, který vidíme skrze naše obrazovky mobilů, počítačů a televizí?</p>\n<p>Každou informaci, kterou vidíme je důležité si ověřovat z více zdrojů a nepočítat s její pravdivostí.</p>\n<p>Toto dílo vzniklo pořízením jedné fotografie a následným opakovaným fotografováním té samé fotografie z monitoru počítače.</p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-8.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-9.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-9.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-10.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-10.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-11.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-12.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-12.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-13.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-13.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-14.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-14.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-15.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-15.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-16.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-16.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-17.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-17.gif\" alt=\"animace složená z obrázků výše\"> </a>  </figure> </div> ",
  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Distortion of Information</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> August 2018 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>How many intermediaries does an article we see on the internet pass through before it reaches us? Can we trust its accuracy? How different is the world we see through our cell phone, computer, and TV screens?</p>\n<p>It’s important to verify every piece of information we see from multiple sources and not take its accuracy for granted.</p>\n<p>This work was created by taking a single photograph and then repeatedly photographing that same image from a computer monitor.</p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-8.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-9.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-9.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-10.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-10.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-11.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-12.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-12.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-13.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-13.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-14.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-14.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-15.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-15.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-16.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-16.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-17.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/pokriveni-informace-obr-17.gif\" alt=\"animace složená z obrázků výše\"> </a>  </figure> </div> ",
